  o Minor bugfixes (buffers):
    - When searching a buffer for a string (such as the end of HTTP headers
      on a DirPort or MetricsPort connection), skip over any empty buffer
      chunks instead of reading stale bytes past the end of a chunk's data
      or stopping early at an empty chunk spliced into the middle of a
      buffer. Previously, a partial delimiter right before an empty tail
      chunk could falsely match against unused chunk memory and cause the
      request to be rejected. Fixes bug 41377; bugfix on 0.2.0.16-alpha.
